sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Client
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as TrustyAI Operator<br/>(Manager Pod)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TAS as TrustyAI Service<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant Driver as LMES Driver<br/>(Sidecar)
    participant EvalCtrl as EvalHub Controller

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        note over User,TAS: Flow 1: TrustyAIService Deployment
        User->>K8sAPI: Create TrustyAIService CR<br/>Auth: User token
        K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch notification<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment, Service, Route<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        User->>Route: POST /v1/info (inference request)<br/>HTTPS / Bearer token
        Route->>Proxy: Forward (TLS re-encrypt)<br/>8443/TCP
        Proxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>Proxy: Auth result
        Proxy->>TAS: Forward to upstream<br/>HTTP localhost:8081
        TAS-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>Route: Encrypted response
        Route-->>User: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        note over User,Driver: Flow 2: LMEvalJob Execution
        User->>K8sAPI: Create LMEvalJob CR<br/>Auth: User token
        K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch notification<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Job + Driver sidecar<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        Driver->>K8sAPI: Update LMEvalJob status<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        note over User,EvalCtrl: Flow 3: EvalHub Multi-Tenant Setup
        User->>K8sAPI: Create EvalHub CR<br/>Auth: Admin token
        K8sAPI->>EvalCtrl: Watch notification<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
        EvalCtrl->>K8sAPI: Discover tenant namespaces<br/>(label selector query)
        EvalCtrl->>K8sAPI: Propagate RBAC, ConfigMaps,<br/>ServiceAccounts to tenants
    end
